Title: LMCache native tiered KV cache, CacheBlend, and fast prefill bypass
Add-on: LMCache hardware-accelerated chunked KV reuse and non-prefix CacheBlend prefill acceleration.
  --lmcache: bypass prompt prefill whenever tokens match previous prompt chunks in RAM or NVMe
  --lmcache-chunk-size N: token block size for hashing (default: 256)
  --lmcache-ram-mb N: pinned host RAM allocation for hot chunks (default: 16384 MiB)
  --lmcache-disk: persist cold chunks to local NVMe storage
  --lmcache-disk-dir DIR: path to storage folder (default: ./data/lmcache)
  --lmcache-disk-max-mb N: maximum disk space (default: 65536 MiB)
  --lmcache-blend: splice pre-computed chunks anywhere in the prompt with RoPE offset adjustment
  --lmcache-blend-recompute F: fraction of boundary tokens re-evaluated (default: 0.15)
  --lmcache-blend-min-tokens N: minimum token count for blended chunk (default: 128)
  --lmcache-compress TYPE: quantization format for offloaded chunks (default: q8_0)
  --lmcache-async-save: asynchronous storage offload on background threads
Requires: 0003-moe-cache-modes-expert-reduction-adaptive-draft-head-subset.patch, 0004-upstream-draft-kv-out-of-checkpoints-and-pinned-host-buffers.patch

